README for the dhs package
================================

This directory contains the sources for the Gemini DHS (Data Handling
System).

Building
--------

This package requires that Drama-1.4.2 (or newer) be installed
in the directory ../drama-v1.4.2, relative to this directory.
You can download the sources from ftp://ftp.aao.gov.au/pub/drama/.

Once Drama has been compiled and installed, type:

    configure
    make
    make install

This will create a subdirectory of this directory called "release"
that contains the installed libraries, include files and test
programs.


Running 
=======

To test the DHS client, you can run the dhsClient application:

 - On the server and client machines (may be the same), run the IMP master task

 - On the server, run: dhsServer <serverName>

 - On the client, run: dhsClient <clientName> <serverHost> <serverName>



Temporary Note on IMP bug fix (Oct 14, 2002)
=============================================

If using drama-1.4.2/imp-1.6.1, you need to apply this fix
to drama-v1.4.2/drama_source/imp/accconnect.c:

Replace line (124):
    AccMessage.Task = *TaskID;

with:
   AccMessage.Task.Machine = TaskID->Machine;
   AccMessage.Task.Pid = htonl(TaskID->Pid);

Newer versions of IMP should already contain this fix.
